# Everything the image must not carry: local installs, build output, secrets.
**/node_modules
**/.medusa
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.template
.git
**/.DS_Store
*.log
# The storefront is not part of this image, but npm ci resolves the ROOT
# lockfile and that requires every workspace's manifest to exist. Excluding the
# folder outright made the Dockerfile's `COPY apps/storefront/package.json`
# fail with "not found". Keep the manifest, drop everything else.
apps/storefront/**
!apps/storefront/package.json
